{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52991","headline":"剡县法台寺灌顶坛诗 · 张继","name":"剡县法台寺灌顶坛诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九灯传像法，七夜会龙华。\n月静金田广，幡摇银汉斜。\n香坛分地位，宝印辨根牙。\n试问因缘者，清溪无数沙。\n（《剡录》卷八）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张继","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52991.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52991","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}